summary: Test that confirms that user without the CAP_SYS_BOOT capability cannot use the reboot API
description: |
  HW Risk Assesment test that checks that a new unprivileged user,
  e.g. without the CAP_SYS_BOOT privilege, is not able to reboot/shutdown
  the system.
